-- Page-backed address space. Operations cover the entire reserved region.
public define region as opaque.
public use "vm" function reserve(size unsigned) giving failable pointer to region.
public use "vm" function size(value pointer to region) giving failable unsigned.
public use "vm" function commit(value pointer to region) giving failable nothing.
-- Mode is "none", "read", "write" (read/write), or "execute" (read/execute).
public use "vm" function protect(value pointer to region, mode text) giving failable nothing.
public use "vm" function decommit(value pointer to region) giving failable nothing.
public use "vm" function load(value pointer to region, offset unsigned) giving failable byte.
public use "vm" function store(value pointer to region, offset unsigned, data byte) giving failable nothing.
public use "vm" function release(value pointer to region) giving failable nothing.
